  <spirit:description>Continuous gated-EMA baseline restorer for the raw ADC stream. Sits between the ADC pins and trigger_core: converts 2s-complement to offset binary, tracks the baseline with a configurable time constant (2^k samples), gates the estimator off during pulses with a configurable threshold and post-pulse hold-off, and outputs samples re-centered on mid-scale with saturation. AXI4-Lite: shift (0x00), gate_thr (0x04), ctrl (0x08), baseline/status RO (0x0C), holdoff (0x10).</spirit:description>
